class TableChange {
  definition {
Possible actions that modify the structure or the content of a table:
insertion, deletion and reordering of rows and columns, and changes to
individual cells, including merging and splitting.
The `target` attribute inherited from the _Change_ model indicates the
_TableBlock_ that the action applies to. Row and column ordinals index
the grid of the table, accounting for cells that span multiple slots.
  }
}
